      "description": "<p>Every party wants that healer who will wade into battle and pluck them from the brink of death. Well, that\u2019s you! You have the burning desire to help others. I mean literally\u2014your body glows, practically smoldering with powerful healing energies that can help your allies and harm your enemies. Just be careful not to get too close to any out-of-control water sources as they are bound to douse your healing flames!</p>",
